# FACTS Incidental Billing — Validation Pipeline
# Repository ignore rules.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor scratch
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── output/ IS COMMITTED. DO NOT ADD A RULE FOR IT. ──
# Everything in output/ is generated by the three scripts and could be
# reproduced by running them. It is tracked deliberately anyway, because this
# is a portfolio repository: a reader should be able to open dashboard.html
# and read exception_report.csv without installing Python first.
#
# The data is entirely synthetic. There is no privacy reason to exclude it.
#
# If this pipeline is ever adapted for a real school, that changes completely —
# real output would contain family names and charges, and output/ would need to
# be ignored before the first commit, not after.

# Additional school runs (see the template-engine block in generate_billing_data.py)
output_school_*/
